message: "If you use this software, simulation framework or datasets in your research, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "BACS: Scheduling Inter-Robot Constraints for Multi-Robot Map Fusion over Duty-Cycle-Limited LoRa Links"
abstract: "BACS and BACS+ are transmitter-side schedulers for inter-robot constraints sent over duty-cycle-limited LoRa links. BACS predicts each candidate's arrival age from the airtime queue, admits candidates by predicted server-side trust, and ranks them by surrogate information weighted by predicted freshness per unit airtime; BACS+ adds a pairwise coverage term. The repository contains the simulator, the reported simulation runs, analysis scripts, tests, the ROS 2 workspace, LoRa firmware and the link-level hardware session HWS-BACS-001."
